al_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>\n<ul><li>Items sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tarhun_Mnemonis\" title=\"Tarhun Mnemonis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/25px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/38px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/50px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tarhun Mnemonis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png/25px-Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Tarhun_Mnemonis.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tarhun_Mnemonis\" title=\"Tarhun Mnemonis\">Tarhun Mnemonis</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>The relief carving of Bhaal's head above the entrance to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temple_of_Bhaal\" title=\"Temple of Bhaal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temple of Bhaal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02